# Third-party benchmark source archives. These are NOT kept at all any more
# (owner decision 2026-09-18: ~10 GB between them, far too large) -- the scoped
# parts are vendored extracted instead, under fave/bench/wl_cloud/cloud-tf/ and
# fave/bench/wl_deltanet/deltanet-traces/, where git reveals any change to them.
# The patterns stay as a guard, so that re-supplying an archive to re-derive
# something cannot end with it committed by accident.
